===
 A local-first AI agent token usage monitor (Windows v0.1). Features real-time dashboards, usage trends, cost estimation, and multi-agent support (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Qwen, ZCode). Zero configuration; data never leaves your machine.
